<title>RUSSIA: LUKoil seeks preferred share issue approval - agency.</title>
<headline>LUKoil seeks preferred share issue approval - agency.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of directors of Russia's largest oil producer NK LUKoil will request that shareholders authorise up to 10 million new preferred shares at its June 5 annual meeting, Prime-Tass news agency quoted a source in the company as saying on Tuesday.</p>
<p>LUKoil was unavailable for comment.</p>
</text>
